"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_54",
"text": "Where am I?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 359.99805),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_4": {
"dialogue": "Its a table. On it is a note.",
"offset": Vector2(-1220, -1660),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_5",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 251),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_40": {
"dialogue": "Well, not *you* specifically. Just the next castaway, which happens to be you.",
"offset": Vector2(-1540, 1520),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_41",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 283),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_41": {
"dialogue": "We didn't, like, abduct you or bring you here or anything.",
"offset": Vector2(-1220, 1520),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_42",
"text": "Suspicious..."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_43",
"text": "Aw, I'm not the chosen one?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 353),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_42": {
"dialogue": "Yeah, you got me. I dragged you here across space and time to help me fight this monster.",
"offset": Vector2(-900, 1520),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_44",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 283),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_43": {
"dialogue": "No, she's the chosen one and you're her trusty sidekick.",
"offset": Vector2(-900, 1780),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_44",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 283),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_44": {
"dialogue": "But no, actually people typically arrive in groups of 2-3.",
"offset": Vector2(-560, 1640),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_45",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 283.00122),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_45": {
"dialogue": "Alice here is the second arrival. Hence, I ever so cruelly requested she stay here for someone else to arrive.",
"offset": Vector2(-240, 1780),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_46",
"text": "How long've you been waiting?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_49",
"text": "Where's number 1?"
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([{
"operator": 0,
"value1": "met_monster",
"value2": "true"
}]),
"link": &"1_55",
"text": "Because of the monster?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 388),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_46": {
"dialogue": "Not very long",
"offset": Vector2(100, 1520),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_47",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00003, 283),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_47": {
"dialogue": "Oh really, miss \"I'm losing my mind in here?\"",
"offset": Vector2(420, 1520),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_48",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0012, 283),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_48": {
"dialogue": "Well, I wasn't going to tell them that. I didn't want them to feel bad.",
"offset": Vector2(740, 1520),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_70",
"text": "Why couldn't you leave?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([{
"operator": 0,
"value1": "met_monster",
"value2": "true"
}]),
"link": &"1_55",
"text": "Is it the monster?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0007, 353),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_49": {
"dialogue": "Oh, he ran up ahead.",
"offset": Vector2(100, 1780),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_50",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00003, 283),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_5": {
"dialogue": "The note reads:[br]
Oof, it looks like you've stumbled into the labyrinthine [i]Cliff Side Caves[/i]. [br][br]
People frequently get lost in here, but luckily for you we made this handy map and tutorial packet for you.
[br][br]
1. You find yourself in the [el]Red[/el] Room. [br]
2. You must get to the [el]Orange[/el] Room.[br]
3. Use 'T' to open your transmutation map. [br]
4. Use the stencils from your tutorial packet to hide irrelevant info.[br]
[br]
[i]Please only take one packet, we were only able to make 3 total[/i]",
"offset": Vector2(-840, -1660),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00098, 251),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_50": {
"dialogue": "He had a... let's say independent spirit.",
"offset": Vector2(420, 1800),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_51",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0012, 283),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_51": {
"dialogue": "Good riddance... at least from what I've heard.",
