},
&"1_57": {
"dialogue": "I need your help convincing it to let us through.",
"offset": Vector2(2860, 2360),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([{
"operator": 0,
"value1": "met_monster",
"value2": "true"
}]),
"link": &"1_58",
"text": "He doesn't seem very reasonable"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_58",
"text": "How do you propose we do that?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0016, 353.0005),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_58": {
"dialogue": "We'll need to fight it.",
"offset": Vector2(3200, 2400),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"4_8",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00098, 283.00024),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_59": {
"dialogue": "How's your combat prowess?",
"offset": Vector2(3880, 2420),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_60",
"text": "Idk how to fight..."
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_64",
"text": "He seems a bit out of our weight class"
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_67",
"text": "Oh easy, we got this"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 388.00024),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_6": {
"dialogue": "Its a table with another note.",
"offset": Vector2(-1620, -1280),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_7",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_60": {
"dialogue": "Luckily, those gentleman over there will be more than happy to give you some pointers.",
"offset": Vector2(4220, 2480),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_65",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00098, 283.00024),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_61": {
"dialogue": "I believe the gentleman managed to slip passed right before the monster appeared.",
"offset": Vector2(2340, 2040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_62",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 283.0006),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_62": {
"dialogue": "Or maybe he's the one that put it there.",
"offset": Vector2(2680, 2040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_63",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 283.0006),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_63": {
"dialogue": "I highly doubt he had the means to do so, but I suppose it's not impossible.",
"offset": Vector2(3000, 2040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_57",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0011, 283.0006),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_64": {
"dialogue": "Nah, we'll win. It's 2v1.",
"offset": Vector2(3960, 2140),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_60",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 283.00024),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_65": {
"dialogue": "But please, feel free to take your time to get acclimated.",
"offset": Vector2(4540, 2480),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_66",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 283.00024),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_66": {
"dialogue": "But not too long, please. I don't know how much more cabin fever I can take.",
"offset": Vector2(4860, 2480),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_71",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0039, 283.00024),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_67": {
"dialogue": "That's the spirit! But please do me a favor before you leave.",
"offset": Vector2(4220, 2740),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_68",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00098, 283.00098),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_68": {
"dialogue": "Those gentleman over there have been anxiously waiting to give you some pointers.",
"offset": Vector2(4540, 2740),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_69",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 283.00098),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_69": {
"dialogue": "Won't you please humor them? Its the most excitement they'll get for awhile.",
"offset": Vector2(4860, 2740),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_71",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0039, 283.00098),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_7": {
"dialogue": "Hey, you're getting it! Your next instructions are just passed the [el]Yellow[/el] room.[br]
[i]Stencil 2[/i]",
"offset": Vector2(-1300, -1280),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00098, 251),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_70": {
"dialogue": "Oh, well, the only way out is blocked by this huge monster...",
"offset": Vector2(1160, 1540),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_57",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00095, 282.99988),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_71": {
"dialogue": "But before you decide what to do next, I'll be more than happy to answer any remaining questions you might have.",
"offset": Vector2(100, 3200),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": "Where am I?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": "Are there more monsters?"
},
2: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": "What's with all the colors?"
},
3: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": "I'm good"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00003, 388.00098),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_72": {
"dialogue": "Regardless, we have a slightly more pressing issue.",
"offset": Vector2(1720, 1940),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_70",
"text": "Oh?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([{
"operator": 0,
"value1": "met_monster",
"value2": "true"
}]),
"link": &"1_55",
"text": "Is it the monster?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00073, 353.00098),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_73": {
"dialogue": "Well, *I* think I'm funny.",
"offset": Vector2(-1200, 2300),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_74",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 283),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_74": {
"dialogue": "I can explain more in a moment. But right now, we have a more pressing matter.",
"offset": Vector2(-840, 2080),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_70",
"text": "Oh?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([{
"operator": 0,
"value1": "met_monster",
"value2": "true"
}]),
"link": &"1_55",
"text": "Is it the monster?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 353),
"speaker": 2,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_75": {
"dialogue": "I think its about 30% to each stat.",
"offset": Vector2(960, -140),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_76",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00034, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Dallas"
},
&"1_76": {
"dialogue": "And what stat changes depends on the end result of your transmutation",
"offset": Vector2(1280, -140),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_77",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Dallas"
},
&"1_77": {
"dialogue": "So if you transmute into a [color=blue]defensive[/color] element, you'll get a [color=blue]defense[/color] boost.",
"offset": Vector2(1610.7843, -134.55502),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_78",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 246.00024),
"speaker": "Dallas"
},
&"1_78": {
"dialogue": "Side effects are, like, super important dude. If your opponent be transmuting and you are not, no bueno",
"offset": Vector2(1940, -140),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_79",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Dallas"
},
&"1_79": {
"dialogue": "With 1 attack, you can have up to 3 transmutations. Double if its melee.",
"offset": Vector2(2260, -140),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Dallas"
},
&"1_8": {
"dialogue": "Its a table with another note.",
"offset": Vector2(-1600, -1020),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_9",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00049),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_80": {
"dialogue": "A joy, to those predispositioned to it.",
"offset": Vector2(680, 660),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_91",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00073),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_81": {
"dialogue": "One boon of Blue-alignment is longevity and youth.",
"offset": Vector2(660, 1000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_82",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00061),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_82": {
"dialogue": "Tis difficult to tell of time in a place such as this, but Aegean arrived just shy of 400 years after my day of birth.",
"offset": Vector2(980, 1000),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_85",
"text": "Was that lonely?"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_83",
"text": "Wait, so are you actually a Duke?"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 321.0011),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_83": {
"dialogue": "Nay my friend, though I wish it were so. A shade of Blue beget my name, which I took when my fate was set towards [el]Blue[/el] alighnment.",
"offset": Vector2(1320, 1160),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_84",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 251.00049),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_84": {
"dialogue": "There's a book somewhere that lists all known color names. At least,, there was when I last roamed free.",
"offset": Vector2(1660, 1180),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_85": {
"dialogue": "There were others in our enclave, once. Many have left for new adventures.",
"offset": Vector2(1320, 880),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_86",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 251.00024),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_86": {
"dialogue": "And to preempt your curiosity, friend, we [el]Blue[/el]-aligned are afforded a degree of mobility, though a costly endeavor it be indeed.",
"offset": Vector2(1660, 840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_87",
"text": "Sorry, I don't mean to be rude"
},
1: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_88",
"text": "Fascinating"
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 321.00024),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_87": {
"dialogue": "Nonsense, a prudent line of questions, as perchance you may join us one day.",
"offset": Vector2(1980, 840),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 251.00098),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_88": {
"dialogue": "Indeed. And furthermore, no enclave truly lives in isolation.",
"offset": Vector2(2000, 1100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_89",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_89": {
"dialogue": "We have nerve-like roots buried deep into the foundation of this world.",
"offset": Vector2(2360, 940),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_90",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00061),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_9": {
"dialogue": "Now for something a little harder. The final instructions are in the [el]Purple[/el] room.
[br][br]
[i]Stencil 3[/i]",
"offset": Vector2(-1280, -1020),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00049),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_90": {
"dialogue": "Oh... wow...",
"offset": Vector2(2700, 940),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00122, 283.0006),
"speaker": 1,
"sprite": -1
},
&"1_91": {
"dialogue": "What we lose in mobility, we gain in a deeper comprehension of the world about us",
"offset": Vector2(1000, 660),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_92",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00058, 251.00073),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_92": {
"dialogue": "We boast a greater clarity of mind and depth of memory. I remember each day as though it was yesterday. And without the madness such acuity might otherwise bring, which is a gift indeed.",
"offset": Vector2(1320, 620),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_93",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 251),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_93": {
"dialogue": "We possess great longevity, though that is not unique to our kind.",
"offset": Vector2(1660, 560),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251.00049),
"speaker": "Duke"
},
&"1_94": {
"dialogue": "Your so-called primary type is the composition of your core.",
"offset": Vector2(940, -1040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_95",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251),
"speaker": "Aegean"
},
&"1_95": {
"dialogue": "This will really only change when you level up, so you don't need to worry about it over the course of a fight.",
"offset": Vector2(1280, -1040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_97",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 251),
"speaker": "Aegean"
},
&"1_96": {
"dialogue": "Your secondary type, on the other hand, is highly reactive.",
"offset": Vector2(1920, -1040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_98",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00073, 251),
"speaker": "Aegean"
},
&"1_97": {
"dialogue": "And, of course, eventually your core will be locked to one color in a condition known as alignment.",
"offset": Vector2(1600, -1040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_96",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00024, 251),
"speaker": "Aegean"
},
&"1_98": {
"dialogue": "It forms a sort of outer shell, though the exact placement varies from person to person. Yours, for instance, seems to affect your hair somewhat.",
"offset": Vector2(2240, -1040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_99",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.0005, 251),
"speaker": "Aegean "
},
&"1_99": {
"dialogue": "Anyways, your secondary type is very reactive. It'll react to your opponent's attacks, your melee attacks, and even your primary type.",
"offset": Vector2(2560, -1040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_100",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00134, 251),
"speaker": "Aegean"
},
&"2_1": {
"comment": "Apparently nerves were known about even back in ancient Greece",
"offset": Vector2(2440, 1200),
"size": Vector2(240.00098, 139.99951)
},
&"2_2": {
"comment": "It may seem like Orange/Cyan can have 3 internal transmutations, but I don't believe there's actually a way to reach that state.",
"offset": Vector2(2719.6458, -694.2639),
"size": Vector2(259.99963, 240.00024)
},
